From 9e08cd0db33245653af1f9e3caaff21dc4f3597d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:04:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 57/60] Agents panel right-click menu and moving a Claude
 conversation to the host

Right-clicking an Agents row offers: go to its Warp tab, open in the Claude Code
extension, resume in a new Warp tab, and (for a Claude conversation running in a pane)
move it to the extension. The vertical tabs' menu gets "Move to Claude Code extension"
for a pane running Claude Code: Ctrl+C until the CLI exits, then the host opens it.
warpPanelOpenAgentConversation takes a mode (default, editor, terminal).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
